    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Corry Estates are pleased to welcome No. 6 Millfield, The Links to the market.  This presents a unique opportunity to acquire a well presented and recently refurbished one bedroom ground floor apartment with the added benefit of a sunny west facing balcony.  Ideally suited to first time buyers and downsizers alike, this charming apartment comprises entrance hall, with store room and hot press off, spacious living/dining room with access to the terrace, fully fitted kitchen recently upgraded, large double bedroom and completely renovated bathroom. Impressive herringbone flooring has been fitted throughout, and the property benefits from gas fired central heating, UPVC double glazed windows and a designated underground parking space.  The property is located within a secure gated development which features landscaped gardens and a private tennis court. The location is ideal, being within walking distance from local shops, cafes, creche, schools and Portmarnock Dart Station. There is a host of sporting and leisure facilities in the immediate area, while Portmarnock’s famous Velvet Beach is a short stroll away.  Viewing is highly recommended to appreciate this fine property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\r\n1.55m (5'1\") x 3.11m (10'2\") New herringbone flooring. Store room and hot press off.\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\n3.1m (10'2\") x 1.86m (6'1\") Tiled floor and fully fitted with kitchen units and appliances, including ceramic hob, electric oven, dishwasher, washing machine / dryer and fridge freezer.\r\n\r\nLiving/Dining Room\r\n3.58m (11'9\") x 5.98m (19'7\") New herringbone flooring, recessed lighting and access door to the terrace.\r\n\r\nBedroom\r\n2.76m (9'1\") x 4.86m (15'11\") New herringbone flooring and two double fitted wardrobes and overhead units.\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n1.68m (5'6\") x 2.07m (6'9\") Fully tiled walls and floor, newly refurbished and including large shower unit, whb, wc with custom made drawer unit.\r\n\r\nOutside: West facing terrace and designated car parking space"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Fully Refurbished bathroom\r\nUpgraded Kitchen\r\nNew Herringbone Flooring\r\nWest Facing Terrace\r\nGas Fired Central Heating\r\nUPVC Double Glazed Windows\r\nDesignated Parking space\r\nManagement Fee:  €1,422 Per Annum"
      },
